\ Regression: a quotation embedded in a container literal resolves its own module-private word when
\ the extracted quotation is `call`ed from a context where that module's frame is not live --
\ checked inside a runtime-image AOT binary.
\
\ The library's `handlers` returns an `H{ }` table whose value is `[ tag ]`, where `tag` is
\ module-private. This file extracts that quotation and calls it at its own top level. The embedded
\ quotation must carry the library's defining module for its bare `tag` to resolve. Must print
\ "LIB-TAG".
use { handlers: } "./support/mod_deps_container_holder.1z" ;

handlers probe: @get call print-line
